    "documentation_notes": "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n### Put all models in the models folder, organized into their respective subfolders. \n### If a required folder doesn’t exist, create it.\n\n---\n\n\n## 🟣 Load Diffusion Model\n### Download the model **flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors** ~9.1GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2` \n\nLearn More about this model [HERE](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8)\n \n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors**  from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`  \n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **flux2-vae** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n-\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\nA photorealistic lifestyle portrait of a young couple standing close together indoors, the woman holding a small white and brown Jack Russell type dog in her arms, both looking at the camera with warm natural smiles, relaxed and affectionate, casual white shirts, soft daylight coming from a nearby window, cozy room in the background, realistic skin tones, natural facial details, detailed dog fur, soft shadows, shallow depth of field, professional candid photography, intimate couple moment, high realism, clean composition, high detail"
